      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. PW-4"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8e05d7130b1746da9a9c1f5e92e41d35_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They have not supported the version of the prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "13a6e65aa4294f24bce8b846035cf927_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "All other witnesses are formal witnesses, examining them would have been a futile exercise."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ec1f2e16eda047b4aa6452c2b9583f8c_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly PE was closed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "766d65757d064f58b61e3aa0030d2127_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Statement U/s 313 Cr.P.C. is dispensed with as no incriminating evidence has come on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f9965bb4a7e7467295ada435b3cd35a1_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. It is a cardinal principle of criminal jurisprudence that prosecution has to prove its case beyond reasonable doubts by leading reliable, cogent and convincing evidence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "73c8755dfd99416bb972f6c1dc371faf_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, it is a settled proposition of criminal law that in order to successfully bring home the guilt of the accused,\nprosecution is supposed to stand on its own legs and it cannot derive any benefits whatsoever from the weakness, if any,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f596e505b4e240228d5723903c316671_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accused is entitled to the benefit of every reasonable doubt in the prosecution story and any such doubt in the prosecution case entitles the accused to acquittal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fef631f3488d47d9aeb97a3ac7b43978_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. PW 1, PW 2 & PW-3 who were the main witnesses have not identified the accused as the person who committed offence neither they have identified the offending vehicle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "818fe900f5ca4fb1886056081a08168f_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Prosecution has failed to establish the identity of accused and offending vehicle in present case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "22bde43e5e654f6db5b711a1d96ff0e6_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. In such circumstances it cannot be said that prosecution has proved its case beyond reasonable doubt."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ec0ad67ea7194088b53f6261d2245d7a_49",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
